    <briefdescription>
<para>Type representing the grid level in CUDA thread hierarchy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This type can be used in hierarchy queries to refer to the grid level or to get that level from the hierarchy. There is a constexpr variable of this type available for convenience named grid. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
